<title>UK: Land sells London building to German fund.</title>
<headline>Land sells London building to German fund.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>British property group Land Securities Plc said on Monday that it has sold a property investment in central London to German fund DIFA for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>Weekend newspapers said the sale of the building was fetching more than 110 million stg.</p>
<p>DIFA belongs to the co-operative banking group of Volksbanken Raffeisenbanken.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
